      "caption": "Figure 1. An overview of the KERNEL framework. KERNEL integrates multi-modal data, including morphological, genotypic, and single-cell transcriptomic knowledge. Phenotypic contrastive edges are incorporated into the knowledge graph. Subgraph-based HGNNs, combined with neighborhood consistency regularization, are then used for supervised learning.",
