    "extraction": {
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of the FusionAgent framework. Recognition models are wrapped as tools to generate score vectors and predicted identities based on gallery features. The MLLM agent receives multimodal biometric inputs and performs a reasoning-action step through multi-turn, selectively invokes tools, and integrates predictions into a final identity decision and fused score vector. The agent is optimized with reinforcement fine-tuning using rule-based rewards, including the proposed metric-based reward.",
