      "figure": "Figure 7",
      "caption": "Figure 7 : The overall architecture of the model, with the pink region highlighting our proposed method. (a) Firstly, we propose suppressing the visual learning to resist its shortcut during the finetuning, which constrains the model to focus more on the cross-modal alignment.\n(b) Then, we propose using semantic relationships to gradually align the internal relationships of the visual modality with those of the text modality, thereby enhancing cross-modal alignment.",
