      "id": "cvpr26-d46ac60024ce",
      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. The pipeline of our framework. From VGGSound categories, we construct concept dictionaries with more descriptive terms for each class. An LLM generates visual prompts for image synthesis, while concepts are used directly for audio generation. The resulting synthetic data is then used to train a sound source localization model.",
