      "caption": "Figure 3. Pipeline of the proposed DetAny4D model. RGB sequence with prompts are encoded with the feature extractor, generating tokens T t, image embeddings Et img, and depth and camera-related embeddings Et d,m,c. A Geometry Context Transformer then inject 3D space embeddings in a transformer control manner, and together with embeddings decoded by the Spatiotemporal Transformer to generate prediction results. Multi-task heads are employed for effective training.",
