      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. Overview of the proposed framework. Face images used are from CDF-v2 [29]. It has three main parts: (1) Query-Driven Token Mechanism that gathers forgery patches using learnable queries; (2) Fake-Likelihood Contrastive Learning that adjusts weights of patch token for contrastive losses based on fake-likelihood estimation; (3) Real-Attention Alignment Learning that guides attention to stay consistent with real images.",
