      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Network architecture of œÄ3 mos. After patchifying input images into tokens using DINOv2, we apply alternating frame- wise and global self-attention. The fused tokens are fed into three prediction heads: a depth head for estimating depth, a camera head for predicting relative poses, and a moving object segmenta- tion (MOS) head for producing motion probabilities. We highlight the MOS head as the key addition compared to œÄ3.",
